  alternative more stable way is to subtract the maximum of x from each of the
  values.

  ```python

    def stable_softmax(x):
      z = x - tf.reduce_max(x)
      numerator = tf.exp(z)
      denominator = tf.reduce_sum(numerator)
      return numerator / denominator
  ```

